          "rawSql": "SELECT workflow, pass, labels['state'] AS state, count() AS problems\nFROM wf.metric_points FINAL\nWHERE metric = 'finding' AND $__timeFilter(time)\n  AND $__conditionalAll(workflow IN (${workflow:singlequote}), $workflow)\nGROUP BY workflow, pass, state\nORDER BY workflow, pass, state"
